             0.30 m full-width holes every 1.50 m in x.
             Hole centres x = [-0.75, 0.75, 2.25, 3.75, 5.25, 6.75, 8.25, 9.75]...  Hole depth 0.05 m. -->
        <geom name="gap_strip_0" type="box" size="0.6000 2.5 0.0250" pos="-1.5 0 -0.0250" material="groundplane" friction="1.0 0.005 0.0"/>
